# Local Proxy (Dev Only)

`server/index.js` — Express reverse proxy:

- Forwards `/api/v1/admin/*` to `SUB2API_BASE_URL` with injected `SUB2API_ADMIN_API_KEY`
- Redacts `credentials` from `/accounts*` responses
- `/api/v1/keys` aggregation endpoint (404 on real backend without proxy)

Env vars: `SUB2API_BASE_URL`, `SUB2API_ADMIN_API_KEY`, `PORT`, `ALLOW_ORIGIN`

Run: `npm run proxy` or `npm run dev:web-proxy`
